---
import Container from '~/components/layout/Container.astro';
import Button from '~/components/ui/Button.astro';
---

<section class="relative bg-navy-900 text-gray-50 py-20 md:py-24 bg-noise overflow-hidden">
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-50"
    style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, var(--color-copper-500) 0%, transparent 60%); opacity: 0.08;"
  ></div>

  <Container class="relative z-10 text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Janela aberta · 18 meses</p>
    <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-[1.1] text-balance max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      Quem reorganiza captura. <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="text-copper-400 italic font-light">Quem espera, paga.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-xl mx-auto text-pretty">
      A Sessão Estratégica é gratuita e dura 45 minutos. Você sai com clareza sobre o
      potencial de captura na sua operação — e sem compromisso.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <Button href="#sessao-estrategica" variant="primary" size="lg">
        Quero agendar a minha Sessão
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3 8H13M13 8L8 3M13 8L8 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </Button>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
